# Overview

VEONIX is an AI-powered academic learning and revision platform that helps students understand concepts instead of memorizing them.

The platform transforms study material into interactive revision resources using AI, enabling students to revise faster and retain information more effectively.

VEONIX focuses on conceptual learning, personalized revision, and AI-assisted study.

---

# Vision

Build the best AI-powered study companion for students.

Instead of replacing learning, VEONIX should simplify revision and improve conceptual understanding.

---

